1
00:00:01,067 --> 00:00:02,533
Sir Ping?

2
00:00:02,533 --> 00:00:04,167
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

3
00:00:04,167 --> 00:00:06,133
[SHERYN] Sir Ping?

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,200
He went to a mythical place.
Just come back next week.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,533
Wait, wait, wait!

6
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:13,500
- Me first.
- No, no, no, no, no.

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,033
Ah!

8
00:00:15,033 --> 00:00:16,967
Hey, wait!

9
00:00:17,467 --> 00:00:23,600
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

10
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,233
[JUNE] Papa Ping!

11
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:27,333
You look like you need
a drink.

12
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,167
Here. The weather's hot.
Have some juice.

13
00:00:30,167 --> 00:00:32,033
I got you milk tea, sir.

14
00:00:35,033 --> 00:00:36,467
I already have some water.

15
00:00:36,467 --> 00:00:41,767
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

16
00:00:41,767 --> 00:00:43,133
You're right.

17
00:00:44,367 --> 00:00:45,633
It's hot.

18
00:00:45,633 --> 00:00:50,067
[SULTRY MUSIC PLAYING]

19
00:00:50,067 --> 00:00:51,533
[SPITS]

20
00:00:51,533 --> 00:00:53,100
[COUGHS]

21
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:56,633
Hey! It's not that hot.

22
00:00:56,633 --> 00:00:58,500
You're overreacting.
Put this back on.

23
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,800
What are you doing?

24
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,733
What do you mean,
"What are you doing?"

25
00:01:01,733 --> 00:01:04,400
Are you seriously going
to work dressed like that?

26
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,667
Have you no shame?

27
00:01:05,667 --> 00:01:07,333
That's rich coming from you.

28
00:01:07,367 --> 00:01:10,733
You're even willing to sell
yourself for money.

29
00:01:10,733 --> 00:01:13,067
How many guys have
you fooled?

30
00:01:13,067 --> 00:01:15,667
Hey, hey, hey.
Let me tell you.

31
00:01:15,667 --> 00:01:17,667
I worked for everything
I have.

32
00:01:17,667 --> 00:01:19,333
I pour myself
into work,

33
00:01:19,333 --> 00:01:22,633
so I have no time
to flirt like you.

34
00:01:22,633 --> 00:01:25,833
You two are so noisy.
I can't focus here.

35
00:01:25,833 --> 00:01:28,567
You heard him,
so stop bothering him.

36
00:01:31,533 --> 00:01:33,467
Hey, hey, hey!

37
00:01:33,467 --> 00:01:35,133
- Put this on.
- No!

38
00:01:35,133 --> 00:01:36,167
[WATER SPLASHES]

39
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:38,367
My stuff!

40
00:01:39,133 --> 00:01:41,500
I'll get it.
I'm here anyway.

41
00:01:45,367 --> 00:01:48,600
Ow! Ow! Ow!

42
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:50,733
Cramp! Help!

43
00:01:50,733 --> 00:01:52,167
Ow!

44
00:01:52,167 --> 00:01:58,533
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]
